id: riches-of-mysticism
name: Riches of Mysticism
order: 2
optionOf: brigand-combat
optionEffect: 3
# A Unique Ability of 20 TP or less, chosen as it is gained - its Prerequisites shown, the table's - and gone with it
# (racial.mjs).
grantsUniqueChoice: 20
description: >
  Upon gaining this effect, gain access to a Unique Ability with a TP Cost of 20 or less (that you meet the prerequisites for) and reduce the TP Cost of all Unique Abilities by 2.
text: >
  Riches of Mysticism [Passive]: Upon gaining this effect, gain access to a Unique Ability with a TP Cost of 20 or less (that you meet the prerequisites for) and reduce the TP Cost of all Unique Abilities by 2.

---

# Technical and Magical alike - never below half the listed cost (unique.mjs uniqueTPOf).
[passive]
unique.technical.tpCost -= 2;
unique.magical.tpCost -= 2;
